a reflection of his demeanor. Any guest who visits, & there are plenty always feel that which ever school they will return to, it cannot match the wonderful experience of being at MG academy. It's nothing short of a second home. Rigorous training, great partners, 1 big welcoming competitive family. Long after class is done dozens of us are lingering on the mat talking, joking, practicing, no one ever wants to leave the place. That's how it is. He has created a utopia in the heart of NYC.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Thiago", "url": ""}, {"name": "November 24, 2012 at 9:48 am", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-21102"}, {"name": "Marcelo's win over Andre Galvao on the 2006 Brazillian Nationals Middleweight final was a 6-2 points victory.", "url": ""}, {"name": "November 26, 2012 at 1:17 am", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-21103"}, {"name": "Obrigado Thiago", "url": ""}, {"name": "Annie-Claude", "url": ""}, {"name": "August 16, 2013 at 8:39 pm", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-93417"}, {"name": "Awesome bio. Well done!", "url": ""}, {"name": "Chris", "url": ""}, {"name": "February 3, 2014 at 7:56 pm", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-97574"}, {"name": "Why hasn't he competed since 2011?", "url": ""}, {"name": "February 4, 2014 at 1:03 am", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-97578"}, {"name": "Hi Chris, Marcelo started focusing more on his school, his students and his online business around that time and found it hard to take the time to train for competitions.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Markron", "url": ""}, {"name": "June 12, 2014 at 10:26 pm", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-107289"}, {"name": "Marcelo and Kron never fought at the 2010 Worlds. Aside from that, this is truly amazing.", "url": ""}, {"name": "June 13, 2014 at 1:16 am", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-107317"}, {"name": "Indeed, he fought Kayron. Just fixed it, thank you… And wow, that's a hawk eye you have there.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Gustavo Müller", "url": ""}, {"name": "July 7, 2016 at 2:55 am", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-298889"}, {"name": "Is unbelivable the first instructor of Marcelo Garcia, Fabiano de Souza, is not in your database…, the name and the story of a great teacher and athlete in Minas Gerais, Brazil.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Fabiano Souza is a black belt 5th degree, graduated from CBJJ / IBJJF / CBJJE / CBJJO / UAEJJF, black belt 3rd Dan Judo by CBJ / LMJ / FMJ, black Kruang 2nd level of Muay Thai by LMMT / FIAM-EC.", "url": ""}, {"name": "President of the Federation of Jiu-Jitsu Minas Gerais (FJJ-MG), and Águia Dourada Team (Golden Eagle), founded in 1958 by his father, Master Mozart Souza. One of the biggest of Minas Gerais state.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Formed by master Mozart Souza, red belt 9 Degree of Jiu-Jitsu (CBJJP) and 5th Dan Judo (one of judo’s precursors and Jiu-Jitsu in the Minas Gerais Midwest,  student from Takeo Yano) and also by Leo Castello Branco, Rio de Janeiro, student from Fernando Pinduka (Carlson Gracie).", "url": ""}, {"name": "first teacher of Marcelinho Garcia phenomenon, where it began to emerge in regional and Brazilian championships.", "url": ""}, {"name": "It has an extensive curriculum, such as:", "url": ""}, {"name": "1. Champion BH International Open IBJJF / CBJJ 2016 master 3 black belt", "url": ""}, {"name": "2. 3rd place world CBJJE 2009", "url": ""}, {"name": "3. Absolute European Champion IBJJF master black belt (2002) Portugal", "url": ""}, {"name": "4. 2nd place World Championship 2002 CBJJO black belt", "url": ""}, {"name": "5. 2nd place Brazilian championship CBJJO 2002 black belt", "url": ""}, {"name": "6. 2 times Rio de Janeiro state champion CBJJO black belt", "url": ""}, {"name": "7. 3 times champion Sao Paulo State FESP / CBJJE black belt", "url": ""}, {"name": "8. 8 times Minaa Gerais State  champion Judo black belt FMJ", "url": ""}, {"name": "9. South American Champion of judo black belt", "url": ""}, {"name": "He trained with Paulão Rezende (Poços de Caldas), Reinaldo Ribeiro (Poços de Caldas), Iran Brasileiro (Divinopolis), Rodrigo Ranieri – Mike (Formiga city),  among others.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Formed over 20 black belts, many champions and several national and world championships, and coordinates affiliate more than 30 cities in states like Minas Gerais, São Paulo, Federal District, Rio Grande do Sul, Paraná.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Creator of the social project “Golden Eagle Way of Vitory”, coordinating more than 7 cities.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Precursor of judo in schools, with the project.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Marcelo Garcia donated more than 200 kimonos to the project.", "url": ""}, {"name": "The same Marcelo Garcia, even today, when it comes to Brazil, training in the gym that launched in Formiga city, Minas Gerais.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Currently chairs the FJJ-MG, promulgating the sport by the state, promoting various tournaments, graduation, seminars, refereeing courses and rules, etc.", "url": ""}, {"name": "No more, this is a small part of the story, rich in detail, images (photos, news, magazines, newspapers, interviews, videos, witnesses).", "url": ""}, {"name": "Sure your appreciation, thank you very much for your attention.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Flip", "url": ""}, {"name": "November 25, 2016 at 6:43 am", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-300238"}, {"name": "Hi i just saw a match on Youtube where Marcelo loses a decision to Cameron Earl (shitty rules IMO, he got several points for an attempted foot lock)  Unless there is a reason not to add it, it should obviously be added for accuracy. Thanks.", "url": ""}, {"name": "carlos damasceno", "url": ""}, {"name": "February 5, 2026 at 5:40 pm", "url": "https://www.bjjheroes.com/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#comment-535128"}, {"name": "ídolo Máximo….", "url": ""}, {"name": "Leave A Reply", "url": ""}, {"name": "Cancel Reply", "url": "/bjj-fighters/marcelo-garcia-fighter-profile#respond"}, {"name": "Your email address will not be published.", "url": ""}, {"name": "Save my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment.", "url": ""}, {"name": "document.getElementById( "ak_js_1" ).setAttribute( "value", ( new Date() ).getTime() );", "url": ""}, {"name": "#respond", "url": ""}, {"name": "Sidebar", "url": ""}, {"name": "END PAGE WRAPPER", "url": ""}, {"name": "START FOOTER", "url": ""}, {"name": "start f-copyright", "url": ""}, {"name": "© Copyright 2014. BJJ Heroes", "url": ""}, {"name": "end f-copyright", "url": ""}, {"name": "END FOOTER", "url": ""}, {"name": "END OFF CANVAS BODY", "url": ""}, {"name": "END BODY BACKGROUND", "url": ""}, {"name": "(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||a.contentWindow.document;if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a1fd87f6bcc583e9',t:'MTc4NDgzOTU1MA=='};var a=document.createElement('script');a.src='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js';document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();", "url": "